e Bends 3 10-15 Friday - Full Body Exercise Sets Reps Dumbbell Lunge 3 6-12 Dumbbell Floor Press 3 6-12 Wide Grip Pull Up 3 6-12 Standing Hammer Curl 3 6-12 Lying Dumbbell Extension 3 6-12 Lying Floor Leg Raise 3 10-25 Post your post-workout swolfies in M&S gear on IG and tag @muscleandstrength, #muscleandstrength, or DM them to us to get a shoutout on Muscle & Strength stories!', PopularityRank=6, PopularityWindow=N'most downloaded in the past 24 hours',
