        Description=N'This 4-day program is designed to help you burn fat without burning too much time on the clock. You''ll also learn the basics of fat loss nutrition and recovery.', HeroImageUrl=N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/lean-man-and-woman-doing-a-fat-loss-workout-in-the-gym_0.jpg', IsSystemDefault=1, SortOrder=1001,
