        Description=N'Maximize your workout with these versatile and quick warm-up routines! In just 15 minutes, you will be better prepared for any workout program that you take on.', HeroImageUrl=N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/fit-female-foam-rolling.jpg', IsSystemDefault=1, SortOrder=1014,
