    Title=N'Workout Notes', FocusLabel=N'Single Muscle Group', EstimatedMinutes=52, IsRestDay=0, SourceNotes=N'Keep the rest periods short and the weight as heavy as you can go without sacrificing form. I like to keep rest intervals at 60 seconds-2 minutes max! Have any questions about this workout? Ask in the comments below and one of the team from M&S will get back to you.'
    WHERE SplitDayId=@ImportedDayId;
