SET @ImportedExerciseId=(SELECT TOP (1) ExerciseId FROM dbo.Exercises WHERE Name=N'Upper Body Activation Flow');
IF EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM dbo.SplitDayExercises WHERE SplitDayId=@ImportedDayId AND SortOrder=1)
    UPDATE dbo.SplitDayExercises SET
        ExerciseId=@ImportedExerciseId, TargetSets=1, TargetRepsLow=5, TargetRepsHigh=5, SourceSets=N'1', SourceReps=N'5 Mins'
    WHERE SplitDayId=@ImportedDayId AND SortOrder=1;
ELSE
