    VALUES (@ImportedSplitId, N'Backyard Bodyweight Workout For Women: Take It Out Back', N'Calisthenics', N'Beginner', 3, N'Escape the confines of your gym and hit the great outdoors for some sun-soaked exercise. This challenging bodyweight routine can be performed by adults and kids alike.', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-wide-image/workout/woman-fitness-ball-workout-outside-1000.jpg', 1, 1063, N'MaintainActive', N'Public', N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/workouts/backyard-bodyweight-workout', N'Written By: Sarah Kesseli July 22nd, 2014 Updated: October 27th, 2021', N'Summer time calls for sunshine and fun! So why not take your workout outside with this great ‘30’ backyard workout. This full body women''s workout works all major muscle groups. As you progress you can complete the circuit more times. Beginners start with 1-2 times. You can even get the kids involved! Backyard Bodyweight Workout Repeat 3-4x Exercise Sets Reps Jumping Jacks 1 30 seconds Pushups (drop to knees, if needed) 1 30 reps High Knees 1 30 seconds Bodyweight Squats 1 30 reps Mountain Climbers 1 30 seconds Walking Lunges 1 30 each leg Lateral Jumps 1 30 seconds Bicycle Crunches 1 30 reps Plank 1 30 seconds', NULL, NULL, 3, 8, 20, 30, N'Bodyweight', N'Female', N'Full Body', N'["Women","Bodyweight"]', 63);
END
