    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Sundried Tomato & Herb Scrambled Egg Grilled Cheese Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'Starting the day never tasted so good with this easy breakfast sandwich! With the perfect balance of protein, carbs and fat it will get your day started off strong!', 436, 44, 38, 10, NULL, 1, 10083, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/tomato-egg-grilled-cheeese-sandwich', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/sundried_tomato_herb_scrambled_egg_grilled_cheese.jpg', N'Serves 1.', N'Whisk together egg, egg whites, salt and pepper. Add in sun dried tomatoes. Heat a nonstick skillet over medium heat. Scramble eggs until cook through. Place eggs onto 1 slice of bread. Top with cheese. Place sandwich into skillet** and cook until golden. Flip and cook until cheese is melted. Notes: *egg can be replaced with additional whites or left out all together to lower fat content ** Conversely, you can place the sandwich in a toaster until golden and cheese is melted OR wrap in foil and place in the oven/on grill', N'["High Protein Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"436","protein_g":"44.3","carbs_g":"38.4","fat_g":"10"}', 28200);
