    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Crunchy Protein Treats Made With Rice Krispies', N'Snack', N'Craving something sweet? Whip up a batch of these bodybuilder-friendly treats that are sure to satisfy your cravings and leave you feeling guilt-free!', 131, 7, 18, 4, NULL, 1, 10096, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/crunchy-protein-treats-made-with-rice-krispies', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/protein_treats_made_with_rice_krispies.jpg', N'Makes 16 servings. (Nutrition Info based on treats without chocolate peanut butter topping)', N'Mix together honey, peanut butter and protein powder Gently mix in cereal. (This will require you to use those arms and mix! It will come together, I promise!) Line an 8x8in baking pan with parchment paper Press cereal into pan, evenly Put in the refrigerator for 20 minutes to set Cut into squares Drizzle with chocolate peanut butter, if desired Store in a sealed container for up to 5 days Notes: * you can use your favorite flavor of protein powder', N'["Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"131","protein_g":"7","carbs_g":"18","fat_g":"4"}', 25200);
