    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Peanut Butter Chocolate Chip Protein French Toast Recipe', N'Breakfast', N'Start your day off on the right note with this delicious high protein french toast recipe. Packed with protein and flavor, you''re bound to want seconds!', 450, 40, 46, 13, NULL, 1, 10101, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/peanut-butter-chocolate-chip-french-toast', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/pb-cc-french-toast.jpg', N'Makes 1 serving. Macronutrients are for the french toast only.', N'Preheat pan or griddle to medium/high heat. Whisk together egg, protein powder, cinnamon, and milk. Soak each slice of bread in egg mixture on each side. Cook french toast on each side for about 3 minutes or until golden brown. Heat peanut butter until melty. Drizzle over french toast. Sprinkle with mini chocolate chips. Top with mini chocolate chip cookies. Optional, but extremely delicious. Notes: * I used peanut flour and mixed it with water to make the peanut butter. Any peanut butter or nut butter is fine to use.', N'["High Protein Recipes","Snack Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes","Breakfast Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"450","protein_g":"40","carbs_g":"46","fat_g":"13"}', 24200);
END
