    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Kurt Weidner''s Saturday Night Burritos Recipe', N'Dinner', N'Kurt Weidner shares his recipe for healthy burritos. This is an example of what Kurt would enjoy as break in his nutritional routine during his off-season.', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 10130, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/kurt-weidner-saturday-night-burritos.html', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/image/recipe/weidner-burrito-450.jpg', NULL, N'This meal is often used by Kurt during the off season to break up the monotony of strict dieting. It is a simple, fun and tasty recipe that will satisfy your cravings for something flavorful. Spread some hummus down the center of the high fiber wrap. Top the hummus with baked, cubed chicken breast. Add black beans, or if you prefer, pinto beans or refried beans. Add salsa and or hot sauce to taste. Finally, top with guacamole. For more great resipes by Kurt Weidner, check out the video series Kurt''s Kitchen. Video: Kurt''s Kitchen - Saturday Night Burritos', N'["Dinner Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":null,"protein_g":null,"carbs_g":null,"fat_g":null}', 17400);
