    Title=N'Chocolate Peanut Butter Protein Granola Recipe', MealType=N'Snack', Description=N'Who doesn''t love some sweet granola? Give this recipe for chocolate peanut butter protein granola a try. Eat it plain or use it to top your yogurt!', CaloriesKcal=116, ProteinG=5, CarbsG=14, FatsG=5,
