    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Simple & Delicious No-Bake Coconut Corfetti Protein Bites Recipe', N'Snack', N'These no-bake balls not only pack a delicious coconut taste, but they also deliver a little more than 5g of protein per bite!', 67, 5, 3, 4, NULL, 1, 10169, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/coconut-corfetti-protein-bites', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/coconut_corfetti_bites_feature.jpg', N'Refrigerate until ready to eat. Makes about 18 bites.', N'1. Start by whisking together all your dry ingredients (Cellucor COR-Performance Whey Corfetti Protein, almond and coconut flour, baking soda). 2. Gradually add in the wet ingredients (coconut milk, butter and extract, honey, stevia), and mix until dough forms. 3. Once the mixture is doughy, roll it into a desired-size bite and refrigerate for 30 minutes or until set. 4. You can store them in a sealed contained in the fridge until ready to eat.', N'["Snack Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"67","protein_g":"5.4","carbs_g":"3.3","fat_g":"3.7"}', 12700);
END
