    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Chocolate Peanut Butter Cup Protein Mugcake', N'Snack', N'Are you in the mood for something sweet? Give your sweet tooth what it deserves with this quick and easy high protein chocolate peanut butter mug cake!', 335, 33, 36, 7, NULL, 1, 10171, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/chocolate-peanut-butter-mugcake', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/choc-pb-mug-cake-feature_0.jpg', N'Makes 1 serving. Nutritional information does not include toppings.', N'Mix flour, protein powder, cocoa powder, sweetener, and baking powder. Add egg, pumpkin, and milk to bowl. Gently mix everything together until well combined. Spray a large mug with cooking spray. Pour batter into mug. Microwave for 2:00. Cooking time may be more or less depending on microwave and variations in ingredients. I left mine a little uncooked in the middle and it was awesome! Top cake with 1 tbsp. natural peanut butter, 1 mini peanut butter cup, and some mini chocolate chips. Enjoy!', N'["High Protein Recipes","Snack Recipes","Vegetarian Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"335","protein_g":"33","carbs_g":"36","fat_g":"7"}', 12400);
END
