        (MealSuggestionId, Title, MealType, Description, CaloriesKcal, ProteinG, CarbsG, FatsG, SuggestedMonth, IsSystemDefault, SortOrder, SourceUrl, ImageUrl, ServingSuggestion, ContentText, CategoriesJson, SourceMacrosJson, ReadCount)
    VALUES (@ImportedMealSuggestionId, N'Summer BBQ Pulled Pork & Coleslaw Sandwiches Recipe', N'Lunch', N'Summer isn''t complete without a good pulled pork sandwich! Get a solid dose of protein and carbs with this classic summer recipe.', 372, 37, 35, 9, NULL, 1, 10194, N'https://www.muscleandstrength.com/recipes/summer-bbq-pulled-pork-coleslaw-sandwich', N'https://cdn.muscleandstrength.com/sites/default/files/field/feature-image/recipe/summer_bbq_pulled_pork_sandwich_recipe.jpg', N'Serves 4.', N'1. There are 3 options in cooking your pork: You can place it on grill over indirect heat and baste with bbq sauce until tender. You can place pork in a baking dish, top with bbq and bake at 275 degrees until tender. You can place pork in slow cooker with bbq and cook on medium heat ~6 hours or until tender. 2. Once pork is done, combine coleslaw, greek yogurt, mustard, salt & pepper. 3. Divide pork evenly among 4 rolls (toasted rolls are nice!). 4. Top with coleslaw. 5. Serve warm!', N'["Lunch Recipes","BBQ/Grill Recipes"]', N'{"calories_kcal":"372","protein_g":"37.2","carbs_g":"35.2","fat_g":"9"}', 9000);
END
